# This Caddyfile was authored on a machine with no Docker daemon.
# The reviewer should check first:
#   1. Every upstream is a Docker service name on the internal compose network.
#   2. TLS uses the wildcard cert generated by dev/gen-cert.sh.
#   3. Caddy reverse_proxy passes websocket upgrades by default.
